#: scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bb010b6b2e15fc49828aefdd3152228e85e495117877120db00b157f535811e
#. default-sha256: f66aafd7b7eb9ceae3545b8a85c69ade0485ca5600d1f9aa7e2ca2dc4c80da3b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, now, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫You love the theatre, so don’t look so cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vamos, vamos, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫Você ama o teatro, então não fique tão zangada."

#: scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6917b48a51521c5b280ca23b595ddb8044c30bf32fda9d4a962e1e0f941a7fa1
#. default-sha256: ff947d0791b6785c7e747d0c1c8f4f254fa4c11564990ec937191a29335f5b5a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmph."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmph."

#: scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cabb54829c60c3e43198de83087d01790b189e80fe529990f183f43c3ea10411
#. default-sha256: d74d202bc3cfbfe3f614062d9a0db64a2ada518c5efcaeb001f1b0e2dd9f23c6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was out with a man other than her brother that evening—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a rare sight indeed. "
"⟪k:3⟫And she was quite clearly in a foul mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie saiu com um homem que não era seu irmão naquela noite...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫uma visão rara, de "
"fato. ⟪k:3⟫E ela estava claramente de mau humor."

#: scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fe84f1e06842d8fc6c3961a0aa856e82831897f5d56ac67a67004aaf6a6d609
#. default-sha256: b334eeb9827384cdfa1cee11f877f5bf1b430b4e660687807c47a07725566f76
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I will ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ stand for this...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That I should have to marry a man as "
"disagreeable as Arthur!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫It’s unthinkable!)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Eu ⟪k:1⟫não⟪k:2⟫ vou aceitar isso...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Que eu deveria me casar com um homem tão "
"desagradável quanto Arthur!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫É impensável!)"

#: scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54b32dad613a5df148110b999716e24308f3c21bbbd92f609bcffde2f0dff233
#. default-sha256: 2608cb8ff7caedeaa4dda047c9a844613cb6361c52315eb4e738ce2204eee8f5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The young man at her side was Nellie’s fiancé, selected by her parents."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O jovem ao seu lado era o noivo de Nellie, escolhido por seus pais."

#: scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5deb13a233c60a9ff005b281a3c0ce9a6b3fe90bae656ec9a71b2ab8862bd0b8
#. default-sha256: 4cbcdbc26f6b05c043a523ffab1a6d6d88fe1b7b40f55742727cda2a10512b2a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On any other occasion, she would have snubbed an invitation from any man who was not Mell, "
"but she had little say in this matter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Em qualquer outra ocasião, ela teria esnobado um convite de qualquer homem que não fosse "
"Mell, mas ela tinha pouco a dizer sobre essa questão."

#: scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5cbfdac1b38536b50c637312ec24e31e8d2647de4f14b241d6d3deef856581f5
#. default-sha256: 72c5b41a8c4076acdeeb5b900fd188e0dffa55b5c482901b12be96e7e61e6952
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was, for lack of a better word, ⟪k:1⟫forced⟪k:2⟫ to go out with him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ela foi, por falta de uma palavra melhor, ⟪k:1⟫forçada⟪k:2⟫ a sair com ele."

#: scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbc904ea192e5537b8a26df4ba39d2f4568925887ee62ec96f3a286dd2fa66dd
#. default-sha256: 57a238cb205c6e605e23f26518c0f70ee7a2ba8079d5812c6900ecc8c4bfb0c7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And oh, how furiously she had fought against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E ah, quão furiosamente ela lutou contra isso."

#: scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b55d9e4ccf3aa24985e4c0742215c7f53e7d6b3d08112826dc669a0761874be6
#. default-sha256: 017d7eb283ce321736f5007a50cb2356c15b5efaaa32f1759b1fb32ca79fde77
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had shoved aside the abigail trying to fasten her corset, locked herself in her room, "
"and sobbed for quite some time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela empurrou para o lado a abigail tentando abotoar o espartilho, se trancou no quarto e "
"chorou por um bom tempo."

#: scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3819bdcc6ad399140c32849d726c341c897f4ac55cd7101d8c40a15c07b87e65
#. default-sha256: 5120c5c6eb528e09dba32c408e3c610588080bc4d9e7a67b4a24f9088dfa1247
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It required the combined efforts of several of us to get her ready and out the door for her "
"date."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Exigiu os esforços combinados de várias de nós para prepará-la e fazê-la sair para seu "
"encontro."

#: scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d2aa9a617d98fe4fe48d8e5bd6f63a8f77c03bc80545dc2cf15d4f6284545c9
#. default-sha256: 8a940d35bec1f6dbb8bc07f9fd92e53bfa4871f9d48b45abe2b3d81238d73531
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Come now, you should at least ⟪k:4⟫pretend⟪k:5⟫ you’re enjoying yourself.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Or do you want people to think we don’t get along?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vamos lá, você deveria pelo menos ⟪k:4⟫fazer de conta⟪k:5⟫ que está se "
"divertindo.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ou você quer que as pessoas pensem que não nos damos bem?"

#: scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 916adec888a81e4b1acc9a7325daed12c0d210f6750a28b0f72f599c42e98774
#. default-sha256: eae716825df8fa5014f691f45f3418dc15cf42a02a7ad306014f05761ae2be4d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do⟪k:3⟫ we get along?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nós nos ⟪k:2⟫damos⟪k:3⟫ bem?"

#: scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a84691ace4db0b42e7ab110510671df2566d7331c13e5f835772ff176daa730
#. default-sha256: cd1e4a1c96bf86f33ba410f6d2688010311fde239bad302d4b6e64af2ddfb468
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well... ⟪k:3⟫I want to, for what it’s worth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bem...⟪k:3⟫É o que eu quero, pelo menos."

#: scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b5dec064c9ff110e7b4c442bfb64e266491dee0b78ee30dd580172a8c316589
#. default-sha256: c860517743d5be1c063db23205a64645247c4c12219d0f5d2ab022b62b6fa42d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What it’s “worth” to you is my ⟪k:2⟫name⟪k:3⟫, not me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O que você “quer” é meu ⟪k:2⟫nome⟪k:3⟫, não a mim."

#: scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b07c9b369e1c62f05266974ea8adb035a74c3ac3a04bcb0f15955a549cacafaa
#. default-sha256: 10336e1e465f7753d6d27abb3ac1ab9e09b9c11c9cc6ac4fcb1b15e771439e39
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you really going to be like that?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I went out of my way to take you to "
"your favorite play.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The least you could do is be a little kinder to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vai ser assim?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu gastei meu tempo para levá-la à sua peça favorita.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫O mínimo que você poderia fazer é ser um pouco mais gentil comigo."

#: scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 849747866acbeb4c4f43f43cc3d745d3877a5b8a639fe3d8ebe86e8993748b7a
#. default-sha256: 9a50b7a4343bf8d99e95b117b6d1c6866c57b45be47cca76c263ad7c6155aa07
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was it called again... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Romeo and Juliet⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫It’s been running for six "
"or seven years now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Como se chama mesmo...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Romeu e Julieta⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫Já está em cartaz há seis ou sete "
"anos."

#: scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4a21bec1557feb2836b7200531e16bdf21b8565044f99e1f9f6e37ea5c74dc8
#. default-sha256: ac5da0847d8c369a034d104d0a5bdfd90c5023cd77d01ac7b68b46f954114bf8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A family like yours or mine could pay to have a brand new script written."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Uma família como a sua ou a minha poderia pagar para ter um roteiro novo escrito."

#: scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 456c0961923b6b6cfd78628cc122b2c5d6818c60067604a7a87df02c08579dbb
#. default-sha256: 9567212627b437449e508442f78f3cb3c0f1df8ed95e0c63df3ae12527ee6d97
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So why should we have to see an old play at a theatre full of ⟪k:1⟫commoners⟪k:2⟫? ⟪k:3⟫It "
"may be private, but even so... ⟪k:4⟫Haah... ⟪k:5⟫I would rather just have a show put on at my "
"estate—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Então, por que deveríamos ver uma peça antiga em um teatro cheio de ⟪k:1⟫plebeus⟪k:2⟫? ⟪k:3⟫"
"Pode ser privado, mas mesmo assim...⟪k:4⟫Haah... ⟪k:5⟫ Eu preferiria ter um espetáculo na minha "
"propriedade—"

#: scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb911b2c551842105b0886ce112165bc6dc68c4869cdadbd64bbb400c2620b64
#. default-sha256: 8863178721acba09407c6013a801205f25465803c6a4d477c95eba059c5c6cc4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Stop talking already!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Pare de falar já!"

#: scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d0d5381dacf309c1d0cc1d74b988b2d7b049ac22441070514436a90036e363
#. default-sha256: 36e46fd6b0d53df3ca420a7f62048d7dc26d0ba756e7808c80cc5e26b6c841ef
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why should I— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why should I have to marry someone like you?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I have "
"ab-⟪k:6⟫so-⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫lutely⟪k:9⟫ no desire to marry you!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Por que eu deveria-⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Por que eu deveria me casar com alguém como você?!⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Eu tenho ab-⟪k:6⟫so-⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫lutamente⟪k:9⟫ nenhuma vontade de casar com você!"

#: scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d92e194766ddd1c32fc6e861dacf43e5ce3d43be49be6c00f8f0b03321f4750
#. default-sha256: 6f24cb352ca65684574548c0b1551d3a3efc16c648c6988a355f37b0e7a304c7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whatever it takes, I ⟪k:1⟫will⟪k:2⟫ put a stop to this!⟪k:3⟫I’ll talk to Father as many "
"times as I must!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Custe o que custar, eu ⟪k:1⟫vou⟪k:2⟫ pôr um fim nisto!⟪k:3⟫Vou falar com o Pai quantas vezes "
"for preciso!"

#: scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18e5b85cb4a1c867baa19a34f89e2e096468d4884f74676ec5a3c8750d81a908
#. default-sha256: 4f32f05d054f09385bdc7330081bb1ff1015ea74bb087d56d860e04ad61b3e09
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Please, don’t make such a scene. It’s shameful.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There are people around; "
"remember, you represent your family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por favor, não faça uma cena. É vergonhoso.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Há pessoas ao redor; lembre-"
"se, você representa sua família."

#: scenario:scenario_406485EF_FA15_4EBC_8C65_EE46A5C1DA53
